{"type": "file", "p": "ps3 7z/Ultra Street Fighter IV (USA) (En,Ja,Fr,De,Es,It,Ko).7z", "n": "Ultra Street Fighter IV (USA) (En,Ja,Fr,De,Es,It,Ko)", "ext": ".7z", "parent": "ps3 7z", "urls": [{"u": "https://archive.org/download/PS3-Redump-2024-Individual-Games-Part32/Ultra%20Street%20Fighter%20IV%20%28USA%29%20%28En%2CJa%2CFr%2CDe%2CEs%2CIt%2CKo%29.zip", "size": "17.49 GB", "size_bytes": 18779744501}], "meta": {"path": "./ps3 7z/Ultra Street Fighter IV (USA) (En,Ja,Fr,De,Es,It,Ko).7z", "name": "Ultra Street Fighter IV", "desc": "⬇ Tamaño de descarga: 17.49 GB\n\nUltra Street Fighter IV para PlayStation 3 es un juego de lucha que expande la experiencia clásica de Street Fighter IV. El torneo mundial se vuelve aún más competitivo con la introducción de cinco nuevos personajes, seis nuevos escenarios y ajustes en el equilibrio del juego.", "image": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/ps3/images/Ultra Street Fighter IV (Europe) (En,Ja,Fr,De,Es,It,Ko).zip-image.jpg", "thumbnail": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/ps3/images/Ultra Street Fighter IV (Europe) (En,Ja,Fr,De,Es,It,Ko).zip-thumb.jpg", "marquee": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/ps3/images/Ultra Street Fighter IV (Europe) (En,Ja,Fr,De,Es,It,Ko).zip-marquee.png", "video": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/ps3/videos/Ultra Street Fighter IV (Europe) (En,Ja,Fr,De,Es,It,Ko).zip-video.mp4", "fanart": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/ps3/images/Ultra Street Fighter IV (Europe) (En,Ja,Fr,De,Es,It,Ko).zip-fanart.jpg", "boxback": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/ps3/images/Ultra Street Fighter IV (Europe) (En,Ja,Fr,De,Es,It,Ko).zip-boxback.jpg", "rating": "0.85", "releasedate": "20140805T000000", "developer": "Capcom", "publisher": "Capcom", "genre": "Lucha / Versus", "players": "1-2", "region": "us", "md5": "c8c528e922ca0e7de20a8bf1c056f8bf", "family": "Street Fighter", "lang": "de,en,jp,es,fr,it"}, "size_bytes": 18779744501, "size": "17.49 GB"}
{"type": "file", "p": "MotorStorm (Europe) (En,Fr,De,Es,It,Nl,Pt,Sv,No,Da,Fi,Ko).iso", "n": "MotorStorm (Europe) (En,Fr,De,Es,It,Nl,Pt,Sv,No,Da,Fi,Ko)", "ext": ".iso", "parent": "", "urls": [{"u": "https://archive.org/download/PS3-Redump-2024-Individual-Games-Part20/MotorStorm%20%28Europe%29%20%28En%2CFr%2CDe%2CEs%2CIt%2CNl%2CPt%2CSv%2CNo%2CDa%2CFi%29.zip", "size": "14.48 GB", "size_bytes": 15547781611}], "meta": {"path": "./MotorStorm (Europe) (En,Fr,De,Es,It,Nl,Pt,Sv,No,Da,Fi,Ko).iso", "name": "Motorstorm", "desc": "⬇ Tamaño de descarga: 14.48 GB\n\nBienvenido a Monument Valley, en pleno desierto de Arizona, prepárate para vivir las carreras más brutales y emocionantes repletas de barro con Motorstorm. Este juego te permite competir contra numerosos vehículos (buggys, motocross, 4x4...) en diversos y variados circuitos. Todo vale para cruzar primero la línea de meta. Usa tu indicador de impulso sabiamente para vencer a tus rivales.", "image": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/ps3/images/MotorStorm (Europe) (En,Fr,De,Es,It,Nl,Pt,Sv,No,Da,Fi,Ko)-image.jpg", "thumbnail": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/ps3/images/MotorStorm (Europe) (En,Fr,De,Es,It,Nl,Pt,Sv,No,Da,Fi,Ko)-thumb.jpg", "marquee": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/ps3/images/MotorStorm (Europe) (En,Fr,De,Es,It,Nl,Pt,Sv,No,Da,Fi,Ko)-marquee.png", "video": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/ps3/videos/MotorStorm (Europe) (En,Fr,De,Es,It,Nl,Pt,Sv,No,Da,Fi,Ko)-video.mp4", "fanart": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/ps3/images/MotorStorm (Europe) (En,Fr,De,Es,It,Nl,Pt,Sv,No,Da,Fi,Ko)-fanart.jpg", "boxback": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/ps3/images/MotorStorm (Europe) (En,Fr,De,Es,It,Nl,Pt,Sv,No,Da,Fi,Ko)-boxback.jpg", "manual": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/ps3/manuals/MotorStorm (Europe) (En,Fr,De,Es,It,Nl,Pt,Sv,No,Da,Fi,Ko)-manual.pdf", "rating": "0.8", "releasedate": "20070306T000000", "developer": "Evolution", "publisher": "Sony", "genre": "Carreras, Conducción", "players": "1", "region": "eu", "m